    "detailed_description": "Skate your ride! Pull off epic tricks, stack insane combos, and smash those high scores. Jump into multiplayer and flex your skills in tons of Party game modes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stunts and tricks</h2>Perform aerial flips, barrel rolls, loops, grinds and drifting in this love letter to Tony Hawk Pro Skater, Rush and Gymkhana. Combine tricks, increase your multiplier and shatter the online leaderboards. The smooth and intuitive physics of REKT Party makes it easy to learn but hard to master!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2>Play a session with up to 8 friends or join a public lobby. Create a lobby with your own rules or start a party and select one of the curated playlists of gamemodes. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/bb722e2dadb3e807b35cddb5a52a8cdd.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/bb722e2dadb3e807b35cddb5a52a8cdd.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/bb722e2dadb3e807b35cddb5a52a8cdd.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenges</h2>Each arena provides unique Challenges, from tackling a highscore, performing a specific trick, to collecting all REKT letters and many more. Keep building your xp levels in singleplayer or online and unlock new arenas, cars and customizations!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/63020647acb0c0518d9230c9f8f43112.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/63020647acb0c0518d9230c9f8f43112.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/63020647acb0c0518d9230c9f8f43112.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cars with unique physics</h2>Unlock tons of unique cars and customize them with an array of spoilers, wheel rims, horns, and stickers. Each car boasts its own physics, ensuring a fresh and exciting experience every time you get behind the wheel. Whether you're racing, jumping, flipping, or grinding, REKT Party has something for everyone. And there\u2019s always more cars being added to the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gamemodes</h2>REKT Party provides a load of gamemodes which can be played either alone or with friends. <br><br>In <strong>Single Player mode</strong>, you can show off your skills and snag the top spot on the online leaderboard.<br><br>Play these game modes with your friends in Multiplayer:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Baja</strong><br>Race from point to point, score by finishing first!<br><br></li><li><strong>Capture the Crown</strong><br>Hold on to the crown for one minute to win!<br><br></li><li><strong>Checkpoints</strong><br>Race through all the checkpoints and be fastest!<br><br></li><li><strong>Virus</strong><br>A game of tag! Infect everyone or stay uninfected!<br><br></li><li><strong>Parkour</strong><br>A puzzle platformer parkour, get the furthest to win!<br><br></li><li><strong>Egghunt</strong><br>Collect and steal eggs! Bring to the chicken to score!<br><br></li><li><strong>Hunt 'n Stunt</strong><br>Stunters set a score while hunters wreck them. <br><br></li><li><strong>Rock Paper Scissors</strong><br>Players gets rock, paper or scissors. Try to hit others!<br><br></li><li><strong>Cops and Robbers</strong><br>The robber must escape the cops for as long as possible!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roadmap</h2><br>REKT Party is currently in development, and depending on the available resources we will go to the next phase. <br><br><strong>Phase 1 </strong>(we are here)<br>Demo with single car, single arena and multiple game modes.<br><br><strong>Phase 2</strong><br>Extend demo to include more cars, customization, single player challenges, online multiplayer improvements.<br><br><strong>Phase 3</strong><br>Possibly Early Access version with more cars, arena's, challenges.<br><br><strong>Phase 4</strong><br>Full release.",
    "about_the_game": "Skate your ride! Pull off epic tricks, stack insane combos, and smash those high scores. Jump into multiplayer and flex your skills in tons of Party game modes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/4c56d66b2670d8344b51915504f996be.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stunts and tricks</h2>Perform aerial flips, barrel rolls, loops, grinds and drifting in this love letter to Tony Hawk Pro Skater, Rush and Gymkhana. Combine tricks, increase your multiplier and shatter the online leaderboards. The smooth and intuitive physics of REKT Party makes it easy to learn but hard to master!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a91aaf78e63152f9dd2f54f4288f8ad8.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2>Play a session with up to 8 friends or join a public lobby. Create a lobby with your own rules or start a party and select one of the curated playlists of gamemodes. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut