er mode</strong>, you can show off your skills and snag the top spot on the online leaderboard.<br><br>Play these game modes with your friends in Multiplayer:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Baja</strong><br>Race from point to point, score by finishing first!<br><br></li><li><strong>Capture the Crown</strong><br>Hold on to the crown for one minute to win!<br><br></li><li><strong>Checkpoints</strong><br>Race through all the checkpoints and be fastest!<br><br></li><li><strong>Virus</strong><br>A game of tag! Infect everyone or stay uninfected!<br><br></li><li><strong>Parkour</strong><br>A puzzle platformer parkour, get the furthest to win!<br><br></li><li><strong>Egghunt</strong><br>Collect and steal eggs! Bring to the chicken to score!<br><br></li><li><strong>Hunt 'n Stunt</strong><br>Stunters set a score while hunters wreck them. <br><br></li><li><strong>Rock Paper Scissors</strong><br>Players gets rock, paper or scissors. Try to hit others!<br><br></li><li><strong>Cops and Robbers</strong><br>The robber must escape the cops for as long as possible!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.poster.avif?t=1740512240\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.webm?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222090/extras/a2f674c493c55eba04544b0b872db438.mp4?t=1740512240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roadmap</h2><br>REKT Party is currently in development, and depending on the available resources we will go to the next phase. <br><br><strong>Phase 1 </strong>(we are here)<br>Demo with single car, single arena and multiple game modes.<br><br><strong>Phase 2</strong><br>Extend demo to include more cars, customization, single player challenges, online multiplayer improvements.<br><br><strong>Phase 3</strong><br>Possibly Early Access version with more cars, arena's, challenges.<br><br><strong>Phase 4</strong><br>Full release.",
